arge off may be recorded at the time of restructuring if a portion of the loan is deemed to be uncollectible. A TDR classification can be removed if the borrower's financial condition improves such that the borrower is no longer in financial difficulty, the loan has not had any forgiveness of principal or interest, and the loan is subsequently refinanced or restructured at market terms and qualifies as a new loan.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The following table summarizes the Bank's TDR modifications during the fiscal year ended March 31, 2020. There was no TDR modification during fiscal year ended March 31, 2021\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 F-3\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Table of Contents\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 HDFC BANK LIMITED AND ITS SUBSIDIARIES\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 NOTES TO THE CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS-(Continued)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Fiscal year ended March 31, 2020\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Carrying\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 value\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 TDRs involving\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 changes in the\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 amount of\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 principal\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 payments (1)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 TDRs involving\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 changes in the\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 amount of interest\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 payments (2)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 TDRs involving\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 changes in the\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 amount of both\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 principal and\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 interest payments\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Balance of\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 principal\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 forgiven\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Net P&L\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 impact (3)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (In millions)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Retail Loans:\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Retail business banking\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Rs. 964.1 Rs. - Rs. 964.1 Rs. - Rs. - Rs. 43.1\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Commercial vehicle and construction equipment finance\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 - - - - - -\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Wholesale loans\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 - 