\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2 's cenbank changes tack on  \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention \highlight\uc2 , focuses on forwards market\b0\par\par\uc2 475 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Oktober 2018\par 17:34\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2018 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 (Adds \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  details, quotes, background)\par \par \uc2 By Suvashree Choudhury and Swati Bhat\par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, Oct 11 (Reuters) - \uc2 India's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has changed tack in its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy, increasing its participation in the derivatives market in relation to the spot market in an apparent attempt to avoid a cash crunch in the banking system.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Reserve Bank of India\uc2  sold $4.95 billion in the forward dollar-rupee market in August, its highest reported monthly sale this year, according to the RBI's monthly bulletin. In July, RBI data showed no forwards market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  at all.\par \par \uc2 In contrast to forwards, the RBI sold only a net $2.32 billion in August in the spot market, marginally above the $1.87 billion figure for July.\par \par \uc2 The rupee has weakened more than 14 percent since January, making it the worst hit \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the region amid an emerging market rout. Domestic concerns around capital outflows, and a widening current account deficit due to the rising cost of crude oil imports have also hit the Indian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 While this prompted the government to raise import tariffs on several items, markets continue to fret about the outlook for the rupee after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  refrained from raising interest rates last week.\par \par \uc2 "Given that the RBI abstained from raising interest rates, it left a perception that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was not too worried about the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  depreciation," said Abhishek Upadhyay, senior economist at ICICI Securities Primary Dealership.\par \par \uc2 "However, government clearly looks a lot more worried and the RBI may be expected to use its \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves more aggressively to manage the pace of the fall as key psychological levels draw near."\par \par \uc2 The rupee started hitting a series of record lows in late July and on Thursday it touched another at 74.4850 to the dollar, spurring worries it will breach the 75 mark soon.\par \par \uc2 The RBI has sold nearly $19 billion from the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves between April and August to stem the slide. That has drained roughly 1.4 trillion rupees from banks, creating a cash crunch.\par \par \uc2 Overall, the RBI has trimmed its spot \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  since July after selling about $14.4 billion in the three months since April, about 3.4 percent of \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves. India's \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves stood at $400.5 billion as of Sept. 28, down from $424.36 billion at the end of May.\par \par \uc2 "This is an unusual situation where the RBI is choosing to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  through the derivatives markets more than the spot," said Anindya Banerjee, deputy vice-president of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  derivatives at Kotak Securities.\par \par \uc2 "We expect the RBI to continue \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  primarily through its forwards book rather than via spot to ease liquidity pressure." (Editing by Vyas Mohan and David Stamp) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2018-10-11T16:34:48.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020181011eeab02y93\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
