\par\par \b \uc2 EM ASIA  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 -Asian  \highlight22\uc2 currencies \highlight\uc2  largely stationary as US tariff news awaited\b0\par\par\uc2 769 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 September 2018\par 08:50\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2018 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     * Rupiah sees 'decisive' \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par     * \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 India\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  c.bank appears to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to help rupee - traders\par     * Philippine peso rises after inflation at 9-year high\par \par  (Adds details on rupiah, Philippine peso, context)\par     By Ambar Warrick\par     Sept 5 (Reuters) - Most emerging Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  barely\par changed levels on Wednesday as the dollar eased fractionally\par after a series of gains, while caution about global economic\par health kept investors from making large moves.\par     Risk appetites for emerging markets were largely subdued\par ahead of employment numbers from the United States later in the\par week. A stronger showing could increase the chances of four \par rate hikes by the \f28 \uc2 \f2 Federal Reserve\f28 \uc2 \f2  this year.\par     Investors were also wary about the prospect of fresh U.S\par tariffs on another $200 billion of Chinese goods that could be\par unveiled after a public comment period on such a proposal end on\par Thursday. \par     Sentiment was further hurt after news that South Africa had\par slipped into recession, joining Turkey and Argentina. \par     "I think we're just seeing a little bit of a pullback or\par profit taking after a strong run in the dollar earlier in the\par week," said Khoon Goh, ANZ's Singapore-based head of Asia\par research.\par     "At this point there's still further pressure on EM\par generally, and markets are awaiting two key events- one is the\par U.S. payrolls numbers and secondly whether or not the U.S. will\par announce the tariffs when the consultation period ends."\par     The Philippine peso, which has fallen against the\par dollar the past five days, rose about 0.18 percent. The annual\par inflation rate quickened at its fastest in more than nine years\par in August, implying that a fourth interest rate hike by the\par \f28 \uc2 \f2 Philippine \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  may be on the cards.\par     The country has been struggling to contain inflation, as\par well as a large current account deficit. Weak economic\par fundamentals have weighed heavily on the peso and Philippine\par stocks this year.\par     The Malaysian ringgit fell 0.1 percent to the dollar\par and touched its lowest level since November 2017 ahead of a rate\par decision by the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par     The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is expected to keep its benchmark interest\par rate unchanged.\par     Malaysian exports grew more than expected in July on higher\par shipments to China and increased demand for manufactured goods.\par \par     \par     INDONESIAN RUPIAH\par     The Indonesian rupiah was largely flat against the\par dollar, and stood at levels last seen during the Asian financial\par crisis two decades ago.\par     The \f28 \uc2 \f2 Indonesian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  "decisively \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 " in the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and bond markets on Wednesday to curb\par volatility in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank Indonesia\f28 \uc2 \f2 's head of monetary\par management said. \par     Thanks to the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , "we have a stable rupiah today,\par but on the other side the demand for hedging is up, and there is\par already increased activity in the non-deliverable forwards (NDF)\par market," said Fakhrul Fulvian, chief economist at Trimegah\par Securities. "It indicates that rupiah depreciation is likely to\par continue."\par      At 0604 GMT, one-year rupiah NDFs were quoted\par at 16,251 per dollar, 8.9 percent weaker than the spot level. \par     \par     INDIAN RUPEE\par     The Indian rupee fell as much as 0.31 percent to\par the dollar.\par     The \f28 \uc2 \f2 Reserve Bank of India\f28 \uc2 \f2  likely sold dollars at 71.80\par rupees in the local spot \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market to stem the sharp fall in\par the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , two traders told Reuters.\par     \par     The following table shows rates for Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  against\par the dollar at 0609 GMT.\par     \par     \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CURRENCIES\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VS U.S. DOLLAR  \par  Change on the day                                      \par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2                      Latest bid  Previous day  Pct Move\par  Japan yen                    111.480     111.44        -0.04\par  Sing dlr                     1.378       1.3759        -0.17\par  Taiwan dlr                   30.764      30.766        +0.01\par  Korean won                   1119.900    1114.9        -0.45\par  Baht                         32.838      32.79         -0.14\par  Peso                         53.513      53.61         +0.18\par  Rupiah                       14925.000   14930         +0.03\par  Rupee                        71.765      71.58         -0.26\par  Ringgit                      4.143       4.137         -0.14\par  Yuan                     